text:
A nice long walk with the pups to kick off this extended holiday weekend.. .then back to planning for Commerce Roundtable San Diego that's just 16 days away!!

With over 15% traveling internationally and over 70% traveling to San Diego on Sept 21-22...

I'm excited to welcome 750 DTC and eCommerce Founders, Operators, Executives, Marketers, and agencies will join us for 2 days in the sun to learn and network in sunny San Diego!

And we still have tickets left for brands and agencies!

Here's what you'll get:

- 2 Days of actionable content via educational keynotes by 18 amazing speakers who are in the trenches 

- A unique experience right on the water, the entire day , designed for networking and learning

- The BEST (hands down, guaranteed) food that you can have as much as you want!

- $220,000 of on stage giveways happening all day every day (I'm using labor day to get deals on things like: F1 Trip, Hawaii vacations, Apple products, Pizza Ovens, Cookware, Meta Glasses and much more

- A constant stream of snacks, coffee, tea and drinks, yes including alternative beverages

- A live DJ set by our very own DTC Founder DJ with open bar + sunset vibes 

- Plenty of afterparties hosted by our amazing sponsors (dinners, happy hours, experiences, etc) all 3 nights 

Plus you get to network and connect IRL with folks you've been talking on the internet with!

This is all led by our MC and partner: @iamshackelford 

Big shout out to our incredible speaker line up: 

Christian Toetzke, HYROX 
@ezrafirestone, oVertone
@TaylorHoliday, Common Thread Collective  
Evin Catlett, Skull Candy
@jordanmenard, Gravity AI
Eric Venn-Watson, MD, Seraphina Therapeutics
@ChereneAubert, Growth Capital 
Abdurahim Shodmonov, Primal Queen
@EricRausch, New Standard
@jacob_posel, Indigo AI  
Devyn Pukteris, Sweat Pants Agency
@Melanie_Balke, The Email marketers
@bryandstarck, Customer Conversations
@spencepawliw, Evolve Meta
@RytisLauris, Omnisend
@jordantwestecom, Social Commerce Club    
Kyle Yeoman, Groove Life
@ecomchasedimond, eCom Email Marketer
@voids_jannik, Voids AI
@itslukeaustin, Common Thread Collective
@BrettCurry, OMG Commerce
@alexrudolphh & @TylerBrechbiel, TBAR   
Umar Shaikh, Nest Marketing

With special live streaming happening all day via
@ecommcowboy ( @chrisukhall & @colindougherty)       

And special on site pod recordings by @CommnThreadCo 

Don't miss out on the community event of the year!

Beautiful sun, great people, great content, and great food.. it's gonna be a great time!    

Grab a ticket today at: https://t.co/ucsL7usehH 

We'll see you in San Diego!

Have a great weekend folks!

